        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(ui): restore sidebar navigation exports",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nCurrent `main` / PR merge checks fail in unrelated UI/plugin CI after #100535:\n\n- `check-prod-types`, `check-test-types`, and `build-artifacts` fail because `ui/src/app-navigation.ts` no longer exports sidebar helpers still imported by the app shell, settings persistence, sidebar component, and navigation tests.\n- `checks-fast-contracts-plugins-a` fails because `extensions/workboard/index.ts` now registers a typed `subagent_ended` hook but the explicit bundled hook allowlist was not updated.\n\nThis PR restores the missing navigation exports and updates the hook allowlist so base CI can go green again.\n\n## Summary\n\n- restore `SIDEBAR_NAV_ROUTES`, `SidebarNavRoute`, `DEFAULT_SIDEBAR_PINNED_ROUTES`, `normalizeSidebarPinnedRoutes`, and `sidebarMoreRoutes`\n- include the new `worktrees` route in the customizable sidebar route list and navigation tests\n- add `extensions/workboard/index.ts` / `subagent_ended` to the bundled typed hook registration allowlist\n\n## Evidence\n\nRED before fix:\n\n- `pnpm check:test-types` failed with missing `app-navigation.ts` exports.\n- `pnpm test:contracts:plugins -- --runInBand` failed because `extensions/workboard/index.ts` was not in `BUNDLED_TYPED_HOOK_REGISTRATION_FILES`.\n\nGREEN after fix:\n\n- `pnpm check:test-types`\n- `pnpm tsgo:prod`\n- `pnpm test:contracts:plugins -- --runInBand` (`43 passed`, `967 passed`)\n- `pnpm ui:build`\n- `git diff --check`\n- `pnpm exec oxfmt --check ui/src/app-navigation.ts ui/src/app-navigation.test.ts src/plugins/contracts/boundary-invariants.test.ts`\n\n## Negative Boundaries\n\n- Does not change app routing semantics beyond restoring the sidebar helper API expected by current callers.\n- Does not change workboard hook behavior; it only updates the contract allowlist for the existing `subagent_ended` registration.\n",
